WEBVTT

00:10:57.832 --> 00:11:00.527
one member of the Klan

00:11:01.527 --> 00:11:03.097
and his son

00:11:04.236 --> 00:11:06.504
came to my office in Washington,

00:11:06.528 --> 00:11:09.613
and he said, "I've been
a member of the Klan.

00:11:09.637 --> 00:11:12.805
I'm one of the people
that beat you and left you bloody.

00:11:13.820 --> 00:11:15.549
I want to apologize."

00:11:16.530 --> 00:11:19.957
His son started crying,
then he started crying.

00:11:21.159 --> 00:11:25.448
He came up with his son to hug me.

00:11:25.472 --> 00:11:27.071
I hugged them back,

00:11:27.095 --> 00:11:30.427
and I saw this gentleman
three other times.